# Components

- `components/layout/` — Header, Footer, MobileDrawer, page shells.
- `components/sections/` — Hero, ServicesGrid, Gallery, Testimonials, ContactCTA.
- `components/ui/` — Reusable primitives (Button, Marquee, SectionHeading).
- Props must be typed; export named functions, not default where possible.
- Sections receive data from `config/` — never duplicate service/event JSX inline.
- Reuse one split-hero or card pattern via config objects, not copy-paste.
